    "Name": "Haider A",
    "Details": "The A configuration embraces a heavier energy setup. Each arm houses an over/under pair of an ER PPC and ER Medium Laser, echoing Clan design principles. An extra ER Medium Laser supplements the armament, while an iATM-12 launcher brings variable-range firepower. This loadout favors pilots skilled in managing heat while keeping constant pressure on enemies.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Stable Weapons</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.12</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#0064e6>Used with permission from Aries Games and Miniatures.</color></b>",
